      en: ["Construction on the bridge began in 1925 and took ten years to complete.", "The bridge was officially inaugurated on May 14, 1935, by King Christian X.", "It features a total length of 1,178 meters and a width of 16.5 meters.", "Approximately 13,000 tons of steel were used in the bridge's construction.", "The maximum water depth beneath the bridge structure is about 30 meters.", "Bridgewalking tours have been available for tourists on the bridge since 2015."],
